 "chunks": [
  {
   "scene": 1,
   "start": 0.35,
   "end": 1.145,
   "text": "Imagine you put"
  },
  {
   "scene": 1,
   "start": 1.145,
   "end": 2.697,
   "text": "$1,000 in the bank."
  },
  {
   "scene": 1,
   "start": 2.857,
   "end": 4.266,
   "text": "You think it just sits there,"
  },
  {
   "scene": 1,
   "start": 4.266,
   "end": 5.267,
   "text": "waiting for you, right?"
  },
  {
   "scene": 1,
   "start": 5.427,
   "end": 7.283,
   "text": "Well, that's not exactly what happens!"
  },
  {
   "scene": 2,
   "start": 7.703,
   "end": 9.72,
   "text": "Banks use money from deposits"
  },
  {
   "scene": 2,
   "start": 9.72,
   "end": 10.583,
   "text": "to help make loans."
  },
  {
   "scene": 2,
   "start": 10.743,
   "end": 13.477,
   "text": "For example, a family might borrow money"
  },
  {
   "scene": 2,
   "start": 13.477,
   "end": 14.69,
   "text": "from the bank to buy a house."
  },
  {
   "scene": 3,
   "start": 15.11,
   "end": 16.552,
   "text": "But borrowing isn't free!"
  },
  {
   "scene": 3,
   "start": 16.552,
   "end": 18.971,
   "text": "The bank charges something called interest."
  },
  {
   "scene": 3,
   "start": 19.131,
   "end": 21.048,
   "text": "If you borrow $1,000"
  },
  {
   "scene": 3,
   "start": 21.048,
   "end": 23.138,
   "text": "at 8% interest for one year,"
  },
  {
   "scene": 3,
   "start": 23.138,
   "end": 24.977,
   "text": "that's $80 in interest."
  },
  {
   "scene": 4,
   "start": 25.397,
   "end": 27.137,
   "text": "Now imagine your savings account"
  },
  {
   "scene": 4,
   "start": 27.137,
   "end": 28.853,
   "text": "pays 1% interest."
  },
  {
   "scene": 4,
   "start": 29.013,
   "end": 30.937,
   "text": "You earn just $10 in a year"
  },
  {
   "scene": 4,
   "start": 30.937,
   "end": 32.149,
   "text": "on your $1,000."
  },
  {
   "scene": 4,
   "start": 32.309,
   "end": 34.719,
   "text": "Meanwhile, the bank earns interest from borrowers."
  },
  {
   "scene": 5,
   "start": 35.139,
   "end": 37.675,
   "text": "Banks can also earn money from investments,"
  },
  {
   "scene": 5,
   "start": 37.675,
   "end": 38.937,
   "text": "like government bonds."
  },
  {
   "scene": 5,
   "start": 39.097,
   "end": 40.344,
   "text": "And some banks charge fees"
  },
  {
   "scene": 5,
   "start": 40.344,
   "end": 43.542,
   "text": "for helping customers invest in mutual funds,"
  },
  {
   "scene": 5,
   "start": 43.542,
   "end": 45.774,
   "text": "which are baskets of investments."
  },
  {
   "scene": 6,
   "start": 46.194,
   "end": 48.669,
   "text": "Now imagine millions of customers doing this!"
  },
  {
   "scene": 6,
   "start": 48.829,
   "end": 50.386,
   "text": "That's how banks can make billions."
  },
  {
   "scene": 6,
   "start": 50.546,
   "end": 52.409,
   "text": "Of course, they also pay expenses,"
  },
  {
   "scene": 6,
   "start": 52.409,
   "end": 54.023,
   "text": "and sometimes lose money."
  },
  {
   "scene": 6,
   "start": 54.183,
   "end": 55.035,
   "text": "So remember:"
  },
  {
   "scene": 6,
   "start": 55.035,
   "end": 57.277,
   "text": "banks work to earn money using deposits."
  },
  {
   "scene": 6,
   "start": 57.437,
   "end": 59.058,
   "text": "Are you making the most of yours?"
  }
 ]
